cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this analysis code, please cite this software archive and the
  relevant primary methodological and signature-source publications.
title: "Quantifying airway pathway activity and disease heterogeneity in severe asthma: analysis code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wu
    given-names: Suhang
version: 1.0.2
date-released: 2026-08-31
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/njp64fgzwr-blip/ubio-pred-airway-pathway-analysis-release"
url: "https://github.com/njp64fgzwr-blip/ubio-pred-airway-pathway-analysis-release"
abstract: >-
  R/RStudio workflow for scoring 39 prespecified airway- and asthma-relevant
  signatures with ssGSEA in four processed adult U-BIOPRED airway
  transcriptomic datasets, evaluating clinical associations, five predictive
  modelling strategies, internal repeated nested cross-validation, and
  matched-participant compartment and platform concordance. Controlled
  U-BIOPRED data are not included.
keywords:
  - asthma
  - airway transcriptomics
  - U-BIOPRED
  - ssGSEA
  - Elastic Net
  - nested cross-validation
